<title>UK: Waterschapsbank sets 250 mln guilder bond.</title>
<headline>Waterschapsbank sets 250 mln guilder bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WATERSCHAPSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DFL   COUPON     5.125     MATURITY    30.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.405   PAY DATE   S14.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.78     SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) **	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  N/LANDS   TAX PROVS   EURO</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	**5-10 (K-FORM), 5-100-1M (CF-FORM)</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
